PUBLIC HEARING regarding a review and recommendation of the
Preliminary Development Plan and Subdivision Permit and Plat for
Riatta Flats Subdivision, located on Lot 1, Aspen Hills Subdivision,
1st Filing, Laramie County, WY.
24 - 116
PZ-24-00003 & 00004 PC 3.14.24 Meeting Packet
Attachments:
Cate Cundall, Associate Planner, said that Steil Surveying Services, LLC, on behalf of
Riatta Holdings, LLC, submitted Preliminary Development Plan and Subdivision
Permit and Plat applications for Riatta Flats Subdivision, located east of 4340 I-80
Service Road, Burns, WY. The purpose of the application is to divide the 50.49 net
acre parcel into ten (10) residential tracts averaging 5.25 acres each. This project will
require two motions.
